  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "賽局與經濟",
    "sub_ename": "GAME THEORY FOR ECONOMISTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在介紹賽局理論的基礎概念，包含：最佳回應、優勢策略、Nash均衡、混合策略、次序賽局、重複賽局、子賽局完全均衡、貝氏均衡等。其次，將此概念應用於經濟行為的分析，如：產業經濟的複占廠商、工資與就業的決定、國際貿易關稅、貨幣政策的時序不一致、拍賣、尋職等。",
    "describe_eh": " The purpose of course is to introduce the basic concept of game theory, such as ; best response, dominant strategy, Nash equilibrium, mixed strategy, sequential game, repeated game, subgame perfect equilibrium, and Bayesian game. In addition, we try to apply game theory into the economic behavior and discuss duopoly firms, wage and employment, tariff, time inconsistency, auction and job-market signaling.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解基本的賽局概念",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the basic concept of game theory"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "將賽局架構應用於經濟議題",
      "describe_en": "Apply the game theory into the economic issues"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "分析賽局的過程與結果",
      "describe_en": "Analyze the process and result of game"
    }
  ],
