    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div>1. Robert Gibbons (1992), Game Theory for Applied Economists, Princeton University Press.</div>\n\n<div>2<strong>. </strong>Martin J. Osborne (2004), An Introduction to Game Theory, Oxford University Press.</div>\n\n<div>3.威廉‧龐士東 (2011),&nbsp;囚犯的兩難：賽局理論與數學天才馮紐曼的故事,&nbsp;左岸文化</div>\n\n<div>4.&nbsp;大衛．麥克亞當斯 (2015), 賽局意識: 看清情勢, 先一步發掘機會點的終極思考, 天下文化</div>\n\n<div>5. 電影： A beautiful mind (美麗境界), / Ron Howard導演\n<div>6. 西爾維雅.娜薩(Sylvia Nasar) (2014), 美麗境界,&nbsp;謝良瑜, 傅士哲, 全映玉譯,&nbsp;時報文化出版企業股份有限公司</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
