      "tpd_week": "4\n3/19",
      "tpd_reading": "<div><strong>Dominated</strong> and <strong>dominant strategies</strong>, <strong>Iterated Dominace</strong> and <strong>Rationalizable Strategies</strong>&nbsp;(優勢和被優勢化策略、遞迴優勢與合理化策略集)&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Dominant Strategy, 授課重點為：1.以優勢策略重新檢視囚犯困境，2.賽局中遞迴優勢與理性及共同知識(common knowledge)間的關係，3.合理化策略集的意涵。</div>\n",
